{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640960/extras/8cb4c3cb7ae55177ef5af9a19b32bac5.webp?t=1768338581\" width=456 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stuck in a maze with one to three other players. There is only one goal: find them, see them, <strong>GAZE THEM, </strong>before they find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAZED</strong> is a game about using your wits and abilities to outsmart and outplay your friends. Navigate around a procedurally generated maze, hunting players while they hunt you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640960/extras/000840a626a2b139fc06aa136ba4af2b.webp?t=1768338581\" width=456 height=57 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640960/extras/f8033cb8b5a8b5912d890f523037fdb2.webp?t=1768338581\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640960/extras/f8033cb8b5a8b5912d890f523037fdb2.poster.avif?t=1768338581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=456 height=152 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide range of abilities to learn whereabouts, gain a strategic edge, or deceive the competition. Abilities are selected in groups of three, so find what combination fits your playstyle best. From slinking around the map slowly gathering information, strategically placing baits and red herrings, or running in head-first hoping to get the drop on someone, there are abilities that support the way you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When death comes in an instant, you must be on your guard at all times. Use your abilities, anticipate their movements, track their location, mislead their ears, deceive their eyes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...but whatever you do, don't get</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640960/extras/ddbbcb8a8fe39d4865542fbe35ee57b2.avif?t=1768338581\" width=456 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640960?t=1768338581","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640960/0e677c05a330637ae808f30f5a0ed9c7e733e530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768338581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640960/2c0be3228b9963d48661523dfd80c9656cca0c68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768338581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640960/2c0be3228b9963d48661523dfd80c9656cca0c68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768338581","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640960/extras/8cb4c3cb7ae55177ef5af9a19b32bac5.webp?t=1768338581\" width=456 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stuck in a maze with one to three other players. There is only one goal: find them, see them, <strong>GAZE THEM, </strong>before they find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAZED</strong> is a game about using your wits